    <l n="2" para="true">Non debes abominari Ægyptium poft tres generationes.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">Immundus non ingredietur caftra Levitarum.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Habebis fpatium extra caftra, ut egrediaris illuc foras.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Parabis paxillum ad fodien- dum locum ut fic tegas excrementum.</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">Ne tradito domino fervum fugientem qui habitat extra terram fanctam.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Non falles fervum iftum.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Ne fit fcortatrix ex filiabus Ifrael, i. quæ adjungit fe viro fine matrimonio.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">Non inferes mercedem fcorti aut pretium canis in domum Jehovæ.</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">Non dabis in usuram Ifraelitę.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">Potes dare in usuram genti- bus vel extraneo.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Non differes folvere votatua &amp; promissa spontanea.</l>
